{"sections":[{"slug":"米田嵌入","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"米田嵌入"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"米田嵌入"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入是将范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的对象视为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的过程</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">全忠实性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全忠实函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全忠实函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可表函子之间的态射等同于原来的对象之间的态射</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田引理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田引理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一个特殊情形</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}